    {
      "id": "3.62.9",
      "label": "3.62.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "हा मम आर्ये क्व याता असि हा साध्वि वर वर्णिनि\nहा स कामा अद्य कैकेयी देवि मे अद्य भविष्यति |",
      "iast": "hā mama ārye kva yātā asi hā sādhvi vara var.hṇini\nhā sa kāmā adya kaikeyī devi me adya bhaviṣyati |",
      "translation": "\"Ha! My graceful lady, to where you have strayed now... Ha! Chastely and best complexioned lady, now the ambition of my queen mother Kaikeyi will be fulfilled, as I breath my last owing to your straying...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
