    {
      "id": "3.62.10",
      "label": "3.62.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "सीताया सह निर्यातो विना सीताम् उपागतः\nकथम् नाम प्रवेक्ष्यामि शून्यम् अन्तः पुरम् मम |",
      "iast": "sītāyā saha niryāto vinā sītām upāgataḥ\nkatham nāma pravekśyāmi śūnyam antaḥ puram mama |",
      "translation": "\"I have come to forests with Seetha and have to go back to Ayodhya without Seetha. How, in all but name, can I step into an oblivion called my palace-chambers?",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "siitaayaa saha nir yaataH",
          "iast": "sītāyā saha nir yātaḥ",
