    {
      "id": "3.62.11",
      "label": "3.62.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "निर्वीर्य इति लोको माम् निर्दयः च इति वक्ष्यति\nकातरत्वम् प्रकाशम् हि सीता अपनयनेन मे |",
      "iast": "nir.hvīrya iti loko mām nir.hdayaḥ ca iti vakśyati\nkātaratvam prakāśam hi sītā apanayanena me |",
      "translation": "\"People will denounce me as a vigourless and pitiless person, and my ineptitude will indeed be self-evident, for Seetha is led away from me by some tactical being...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "lokaH maam",
          "iast": "lokaḥ mām",
          "devanagari": "लोकः मां",
