          "iast": "mataḥ",
          "devanagari": "मतः",
          "meaning": "[is my] belief.",
          "anvayaIndex": 7,
          "verseIndex": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.62.15",
      "label": "3.62.15",
      "numbers": [
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "तत् माम् उत्सृज्य हि वने गच्छ अयोध्या पुरीम् शुभाम्\nन तु अहम् ताम् विना सीताम् जीवेयम् हि कथंचन |",
      "iast": "tat mām utsṛjya hi vane gaccha ayodhyā purīm śubhām\nna tu aham tām vinā sītām jīveyam hi kathañcana |",
      "translation": "\"Hence, Lakshmana, you go back to that auspicious city Ayodhya forsaking me in forests, because I have no existence without Seetha, isn't it!",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "tat",
          "iast": "tat",
          "devanagari": "तत्",
          "meaning": "hence",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
