          "iast": "na jīveyam hi",
          "devanagari": "न जीवेयं हि",
          "meaning": "not, I live on, isn't it.",
          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.62.16",
      "label": "3.62.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "गाढम् आश्लिष्य भरतो वाच्यो मत् वचनात् त्वया\nअनुज्ञातो असि रामेण पालय इति वसुंधराम् |",
      "iast": "gāḍham āśliṣya bharato vācyo mat vacanāt tvayā\nanuGYāto asi rāmeṇa pālaya iti vasuṃdharām |",
      "translation": "\"On tightly hugging Bharata you shall tell him these words as I have said, 'Rama authorises you to reign the earth...'",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
